<title>MEXICO: Mexico cenbank to unveil 1997 monetary plan soon.</title>
<headline>Mexico cenbank to unveil 1997 monetary plan soon.</headline>
<dateline>MERIDA, Mexico 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico will unveil details of its monetary program for 1997 sometime in the first two weeks of December, central bank governor Miguel Mancera said in a speech here on Saturday.</p>
<p>He said that the complete version of the plan would be released in January next year.</p>
<p>- Mexico City newsroom, +525 728 9559</p>
</text>
